{"3595810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MaskuLand Survival", "steam_appid": 3595810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595810/extras/5332dfad705edce3061658b9206c6d34.avif?t=1779471360\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>You are <strong>Masku</strong>, an explorer who crash-landed in an unknown world carrying a rare cure for your <strong>son</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To breathe you need special <strong>Masks</strong>, each one grants you a unique ability! Repair your balloon and get supplies, fight you way back home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>His life depends on you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>WILL YOU SURVIVE THE UNKNOWN???</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> – Over 50 unique items including tools, weapons, armor, and Masks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook - More than 30 cooking recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building - More than 20 type of structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild - rebuild old structures to gain access a new biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming -  4 types of crops to farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing - Fish with rod and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapping - 4 types of animals can be trapped in land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Husbandry - Raise bugs, chickens and birds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Diferente biomes - Florest, Dark Florest, Lava, Desert and Snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 family fotos to collect.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst